WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:00.319 --> 00:00:05.359
Dearest madams, so charming up there on
the balcony. Just say which of these

cue-2
00:00:05.359 --> 00:00:12.100
trinkets catches your eye and they shall
be yours. A ribbon? A bow? 

cue-3
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:18.839
An excellent choice, madam. "Success to
Timothy Partitool," it reads. And that, if

cue-4
00:00:18.839 --> 00:00:24.379
I may make so bold, is my own name.
Timothy Partitool, Esquire, candidate for

cue-5
00:00:24.379 --> 00:00:30.360
parliament at your service. Are your men
folk within by chance? Do you think I

cue-6
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:35.779
might count on their votes? Perhaps they
would relish a snuff box like this

cue-7
00:00:35.779 --> 00:00:37.840
inscribed Old Interest.

cue-8
00:00:39.599 --> 00:00:45.099
Perhaps if you were to put in a word, it
would secure his support? What man could

cue-9
00:00:45.099 --> 00:00:50.499
resist such beauty, such grace as yours?
